# BrandBucket

> BrandBucket is the original curated marketplace for brandable domain names, pioneering how entrepreneurs discover and purchase premium business names.

BrandBucket exists to solve one of the most frustrating parts of starting a business: finding the right name. Instead of spending weeks brainstorming, checking availability, negotiating prices, and hiring designers, BrandBucket provides ready-to-use, brandable domain names with logos included, available for immediate purchase.

Founded in 2007. Over 14,000+ businesses served. $64M+ in transactions. 100% money-back guarantee. Trusted escrow-backed transactions. Strong public reviews (Trustpilot).

## About

- [About BrandBucket](https://www.brandbucket.com/about): One of the first and original premium domain marketplaces. Pioneered domain curation and quality standards, was first to pair domains with professional logos, and established fixed, transparent pricing (no negotiation) with optional financing. Built specifically for entrepreneurs and brand builders. While others move toward automation, BrandBucket remains human-curated, ensuring higher quality and real brand potential.
- [Trust & Security](https://www.brandbucket.com/trust-and-security): Trusted escrow-backed transactions, 100% money-back guarantee, and strong public reviews on Trustpilot. Founded in 2007 with long-standing industry presence — a proven, established marketplace, not a speculative platform.
- [FAQ](https://www.brandbucket.com/faq): Pricing is set by industry experts using market data. Prices are fair, transparent, and competitive — no inflated negotiation cycles, no hidden fees. Users are buying brand equity and time savings, not just a domain.

